/public/uploads
/public/upload

# Applicant-portal uploads: admissions documents (ID scans, certificates)
# and application-fee payment proofs. More sensitive than the logo/profile
# uploads already tracked elsewhere under public/assets/uploads/, so these
# stay local/on-server only rather than going into git history.
/public/assets/uploads/admissions
/public/assets/uploads/application_payments

# Website-section images uploaded through the CMS at run time. These are
# content the site creates for itself; on the server they live in the shared
# uploads directory, so committing them would fork the live copy into git.
/public/assets/uploads/website

# Public programme cover images. Written at run time by ProgrammeCoverImage into
# the web-served uploads tree, so on the server they live in the shared uploads
# directory. Committing them would fork the live copy into git and put
# institution-owned marketing photography into the repository.
/public/assets/uploads/programme-covers


